@startuml
actor Engineer
participant "WhatIfPanelComponent" as UI
participant "WhatIfService" as WTS
participant "FastAPI\n/dashboard/what-if/compare" as API
participant "WhatIfEngine" as WhatIf
database "MongoDB" as Mongo
participant "TelecomDigitalTwinEngine" as Twin

Engineer -> UI : comparer des actions correctives
UI -> WTS : compare(incidentId, actionIds)
WTS -> API : POST /dashboard/what-if/compare
API -> WhatIf : compare_actions(incident_data, action_ids)
WhatIf -> Mongo : get incident by id
WhatIf -> Twin : simulate_failure / topology impact

loop pour chaque action candidate
  WhatIf -> WhatIf : compute_action_impact()
  WhatIf -> WhatIf : estimer MTTR,\nconfiance et risques
end

WhatIf --> API : best_action + comparison_table
API --> WTS : JSON response
WTS --> UI : afficher meilleure action
@enduml
